   "html": "<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int ch[N][26], cnt, end[N];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">void insert(string s){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    int u=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    for(char c:s){ int v=c-&#039;a&#039;;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">        if(!ch[u][v]) ch[u][v]=++cnt;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">6</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">        u=ch[u][v];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">7</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    }</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">8</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">    end[u]++;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">9</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
   "text": "C++ 复制 1 int ch[N][26], cnt, end[N]; 2 void insert(string s){ 3 int u=0; 4 for(char c:s){ int v=c-'a'; 5 if(!ch[u][v]) ch[u][v]=++cnt; 6 u=ch[u][v]; 7 } 8 end[u]++; 9 }"
